From b81cfc971f7fa5159fed8f731bd21fd1af4a6cfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: trashbim <xmdbsmzdsjcbfmdjc@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:30:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] sm8350-common: Optimize video playback battery life,
 restore core_ctl, and enable SF idle timer

- Restore core_ctl dynamic core isolation (allow cpu7 Prime core and cpu4
  to power off during light video playback and reading)
- Balance scheduler up/down migration thresholds (71/95 up, 65/85 down)
- Reset rtg_boost_freq to 0 on all clusters so video decoders do not lock
  Cortex-A78 cores to 1.11 GHz
- Fix SurfaceFlinger trapped in system-background (0-3) by assigning
  SFMainPolicy and SFRenderEnginePolicy to root cpuset in task_profiles.json
- Increase watermark_scale_factor to 20 to eliminate kswapd direct reclaim
  stalls and OOM-reaper thrashing
- Set display set_idle_timer_ms to 1000ms so display drops to 60Hz during
  static content and video playback

Change-Id: I1f5e05d3a5e96ff53e34ade3d40022595b76642f
---
 configs/task_profiles.json                 | 26 +++++++++++++
 rootdir/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-yupik.sh | 45 ++++++++++++----------
 vendor.prop                                |  3 +-
 3 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

